        "summary": "Dc susceptibility under 1 kOe (300–2 K) shows χMT = 56.5 cm3 K mol−1 at room temperature (four uncoupled Dy(III)), a minimum of 46.35 cm3 K mol−1 at 10 K, then a rise indicating significant intramolecular ferromagnetic interactions. Zero-field ac data show frequency-dependent χ″ peaks and SMM-like slow relaxation. Arrhenius fitting of τ above 4 K gives ΔE/kB = 23.6 K and τ0 = 2.57 × 10−6 s. Cole–Cole α = 0.22–0.40 (2–6 K); Mydosh parameter φ = 0.25, inconsistent with spin-glass behavior.",
